# ✅ 9. Build a “Compatibility Report”

***

## ✅ You can summarize findings like:

| Check               | Result       | Risk   |
| ------------------- | ------------ | ------ |
| session variables   | low/mod/high | medium |
| temp tables         | none/heavy   | high   |
| prepared statements | yes/no       | medium |
| long transactions   | few/many     | high   |
| idle in transaction | yes/no       | high   |

***

***

# ✅ ✅ Interpretation guide (for developers)

***

## ✅ LOW risk (good for PgBouncer)

* no temp tables ✅
* no prepared statements ✅
* short transactions ✅
* stateless queries ✅

***

***

## ❗ MEDIUM risk

* occasional SET usage
* prepared statements present

👉 requires tuning

***

***

## ❗ HIGH risk

* temp tables
* long-running transactions
* idle in transaction

👉 must fix before PgBouncer

***

